mapping "V9040.1" source="V9040" target="215415000" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V9040 = Swedish extension of V90.4 (Accident to watercraft causing drowning and
        submersion, Sailboat) with activity suffix SNOMED CT 215415000. Base V90.4 has Athena SNOMED 437476
        (Accident to watercraft causing immersion, 215415000). Activity suffix is administrative OMOP
        context; broader. Confidence : Athena crosswalk on base, activity-context dropped.
        """
}
