mapping "V9054.1" source="V9054" target="215415000" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.71 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V9054 (Swedish 7-char extension of ICD-10 V90.5) = SNOMED CT 215415000. The WHO 4-char
        parent V90.5 has an Athena crosswalk to SNOMED CT 437476 (concept_code 215415000). Target fully
        subsumes the clinical injury event; the Swedish extension only adds activity context not
        represented in any standard concept. Broader (target drops the watercraft subtype and activity
        axis), high tier: verified Athena crosswalk at the 4-char level.
        """
}
